---
// The site is dark-only (DESIGN.md). Starlight would switch to its light theme for visitors whose OS prefers light,
// which breaks our token mapping (light header, unreadable asides, light code blocks). Always render dark.
---
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
